===Ask the staff why the auction has been suspended{{subst:void|<!--201090202-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|The auction has been suspended because of some technical issues. What issues?<br />Is the Geomarrow Probe that you and Hook have been waiting for still here?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Auction Staff)
:'''Hook:''' What happened to the Geomarrow Probe? Tell me right now! Straight away! Immediately!
:'''Auction Staff:''' Uh... There's nothing to worry about &mdash; it's just a technical issue.
:'''Hook:''' ...You don't sound very convincing! *gasp* ...Did someone steal it?
:'''Auction Staff:''' ...Well, we can't say for sure that it was "stolen..." We've contacted the seller and sent some people in search. We should soon be able to...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This place is full of troublemakers.
::'''Hook:''' Yeah, why wasn't Wildfire keeping a lookout?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Who would dare steal from Wildfire?
::'''Hook:''' Yeah, why is Wildfire so incompetent? You should have put The Moles in charge!
:'''Hook:''' I gotta catch the thief and get the probe back! Any ideas, honorary member?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's have a look at the auction registration form.
:'''Auction Staff:''' Are you suggesting that someone altered the registration form? That's simply not possible! We've been keeping a close eye on everything...
:'''Hook:''' Fool! What the honorary member means is that the thief only came here to create trouble &mdash; they weren't interested in buying or selling! Right, (Trailblazer)?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're smarter than I thought!
::'''Hook:''' When the going gets smart, the boss of The Moles gets smarter!
