:'''Auction Staff:''' ...And I think there was a miner who registered with him. Come on, let's go and interrogate them.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Ask for more information about this suspicious buyer{{subst:void|<!--201090203-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|Apart from you, there is another buyer who hasn't participated in the auction and has left. You want to learn more about this buyer.<br />Although your reasons for suspicion seem farfetched, you still think this buyer is suspicious. Why are there so many thieves here?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Naive Miner)
:'''Auction Staff:''' Hi, excuse me... may I ask where the miner who registered with you has gone?
:'''Naive Miner:''' ...Him? I think he went back into town.
:'''Hook:''' So... he already ran away?
:'''Naive Miner:''' He came here saying he wanted to buy the Geomarrow Probe, but then he changed his mind for some reason and ran back to Boulder Town alone.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where can you usually find him?
