:'''Natasha:''' Hook, you look very happy. Did something good happen?
:'''Hook:''' Mine and daddy's birthday party is starting soon! Can you help me wrap up this gift! I wanna surprise daddy!
:'''Natasha:''' *sigh* You rascal... You only come and find me in situations like this.
:'''Hook:''' Pleeease Natasha! I'll help you clean the clinic for... half a month if you help me!
:'''Natasha:''' Deal. I can't believe you won such a valuable item. Junjun must have fetched a small fortune, huh?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We persuaded lots of people to bid on him.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Natasha's craftsmanship was very popular.
