{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Boulder Town|update|Hook is calling her friends in the Moles. Find her so you can celebrate her birthday with them.<br />Although people in Boulder Town live in scarcity, they always know how to enjoy life. Hook and her father's birthday party will be another happy moment for them.}}
