;(Talk to Hook)
:'''Julian:''' Boss, the "big hero" you mentioned is here.
:'''Hook:''' Julian, knock it off!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} "Big hero"?
::'''Hook:''' Argh, you heard that? Don't get too cocky, honorary member!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are you guys talking about?
::'''Hook:''' Nothing! Hmph, Hook would never compliment an honorary member behind their back.
:'''Hook:''' We were talking about the birthday party. You wanna hear about it too?
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What will there be to eat?
::'''Hook:''' Aunt Gertie always makes a big Black Bean Cake for Hook's birthday!
::'''Hook:''' Oh! Oh! And daddy always makes a huge Roasted Rock Crab for me. It makes my mouth water just thinking about it!
::'''Hook:''' And don't forget about Diggertron! Daddy brings a year's worth of machine oil and Diggertron drinks it all up!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Sounds like they spoil you...
::'''Hook:''' I'm the boss of The Moles! If I don't get enough to eat, how will I have the energy to punish villains?
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Who have you invited?
