::'''Hook:''' I also invited other members of The Moles, and... Oh yeah! Seele too! She couldn't come today, but she said she'd still send me a gift.
::'''Hook:''' I also invited the old witch, Swetta, aaaand... you, of course! The honorary member (Trailblazer)!
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's get going.
