:'''Fersman:''' I do hope you'll forgive the ramblings of an old man, but I would like to say a few words...
:'''Fersman:''' I had no idea when my birthday was before I adopted Hook, and I most certainly did not celebrate it.
:'''Fersman:''' I didn't realize how important birthday celebrations were until I met my daughter... That is why I chose to have my birthday on the same day as Hook, so that we could celebrate this special day together.
:'''Fersman:''' That continued year after year... until I, too, began to look forward to the party.
:'''Fersman:''' Today is an extra special day. In addition to The Moles, Hook has invited a dear and brave new friend. (Trailblazer), I hope you have a wonderful time at the party today!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Thank you for inviting me.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I guess I did help out a little.
::'''Hook:''' That's right, this honorary member helped Hook a lot!
:'''Fersman:''' Natasha told me that you helped Hook retrieve her teddy bear. It used to be that Hook could only fall asleep when she held that bear in her arms.
:'''Hook:''' D&mdash;Daddy! Don't bring that up! Hook's grown up now &mdash; I can sleep without hugging Junjun...
:'''Fersman:''' Life has gotten increasingly difficult since we left the mining town. All those days away at work have meant that your dad hasn't always been around to look after you.
:'''Fersman:''' But fortunately, Junjun was always with you to keep you company when I wasn't around. I...
:'''Hook:''' ...Daddy! I&mdash;I have to tell you something...
:'''Hook:''' I... I sold Junjun!
:'''Fersman:''' Huh? Y&mdash;You sold him?
:'''Hook:''' Don't worry, daddy! I don't need a doll to keep me company anymore! Natasha, The Moles and the honorary member will keep me company from now on, so I won't be lonely.
:'''Fersman:''' You... sold him...
:'''Fersman:''' I truly am an incompetent father. I had no idea...
:'''Hook:''' Not true! I know you care about me the most, daddy! I just didn't tell you because I didn't want you to worry.
:'''Fersman:''' ...
:'''Fersman:''' Thank you, Hook... but the birthday gift I've chosen is...
:'''Hook:''' Huh? What did you get for me, daddy?
